<div class="wrap">
  <section class="ch" id="cleaning"><p class="ch__num">12 · Care</p><h2>Cleaning</h2><p class="ch__lead">The heating element never clogs: it stays clean, that is the whole idea of Diamond. Only the cup, the mesh, the cap and the shaft need a rinse.</p><h3>After every session: the cup</h3><p class="h3lead">Only the cup and the mesh need it every time. Give Diamond 20–30 minutes to cool first.</p><div class="slider tslider" style="--n:4"><div class="slides"><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">1</span><b>Let it cool, then lift it out</b><p>After 20–30 minutes, slide the fork under the brim and lift the cup straight out.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img">{%- if section.settings.clean_lift_out != blank -%}{{- section.settings.clean_lift_out | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.clean_lift_out.alt | default: '', width: section.settings.clean_lift_out.width, height: section.settings.clean_lift_out.height -}}{%- else -%}<img src="{{ 'dm-s-clean-01-lift-cup-out.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}</div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">2</span><b>Loosen around the edge</b><p>Flat screen: run the tip of the fork around the inside edge of the cup so the tobacco comes away from the wall. Basket: lift the basket out first and run the fork around its edge the same way.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img">{%- if section.settings.clean_loosen != blank -%}{{- section.settings.clean_loosen | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.clean_loosen.alt | default: '', width: section.settings.clean_loosen.width, height: section.settings.clean_loosen.height -}}{%- else -%}<img src="{{ 'dm-s-clean-00b-loosen-edge.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}</div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">3</span><b>Push it out from below</b><p>Then push from below, through the hole in the bottom, with the tool. The tobacco comes out with the screen or the basket.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img">{%- if section.settings.clean_push_out != blank -%}{{- section.settings.clean_push_out | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.clean_push_out.alt | default: '', width: section.settings.clean_push_out.width, height: section.settings.clean_push_out.height -}}{%- else -%}<img src="{{ 'dm-s-clean-02-push-mesh-out.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}</div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">4</span><b>Out in one piece</b><p>The tobacco comes out with the mesh. Tip it into the bin and pull the last bits off the mesh.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img">{%- if section.settings.clean_one_piece != blank -%}{{- section.settings.clean_one_piece | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.clean_one_piece.alt | default: '', width: section.settings.clean_one_piece.width, height: section.settings.clean_one_piece.height -}}{%- else -%}<img src="{{ 'dm-s-clean-03-out-in-one-piece.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}</div></figure></div><button class="nav prev" aria-label="Previous">‹</button><button class="nav next" aria-label="Next">›</button></div><h3>Wash the cup and the mesh</h3><p class="h3lead">Warm water and a normal sponge. The same for the cup, the basket and the flat screens.</p><div class="slider tslider slider--grid" style="--n:3"><div class="slides"><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">1</span><b>Rinse</b><p>Rinse the cup and the mesh under warm running water.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img">{%- if section.settings.clean_rinse != blank -%}{{- section.settings.clean_rinse | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.clean_rinse.alt | default: '', width: section.settings.clean_rinse.width, height: section.settings.clean_rinse.height -}}{%- else -%}<img src="{{ 'dm-s-clean-04-rinse.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}</div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">2</span><b>Sponge or steel scrubber</b><p>Run a sponge over the inside of the cup and over the mesh. A steel scrubber pad takes off anything that sticks.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img">{%- if section.settings.clean_scrubber != blank -%}{{- section.settings.clean_scrubber | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.clean_scrubber.alt | default: '', width: section.settings.clean_scrubber.width, height: section.settings.clean_scrubber.height -}}{%- else -%}<img src="{{ 'dm-s-clean-05-scrubber.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}</div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">3</span><b>Stuck? Soak it</b><p>Leave the cup and the mesh in warm water for a while, then sponge again. The dishwasher works, but we do not recommend it: the ceramic gets more brittle.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img">{%- if section.settings.clean_soak != blank -%}{{- section.settings.clean_soak | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.clean_soak.alt | default: '', width: section.settings.clean_soak.width, height: section.settings.clean_soak.height -}}{%- else -%}<img src="{{ 'dm-s-clean-06-soak.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}</div></figure></div><button class="nav prev" aria-label="Previous">‹</button><button class="nav next" aria-label="Next">›</button></div><a class="cl-glove" href="../partner-v2/product.html#x-glove">{%- if section.settings.acc_glove != blank -%}{{- section.settings.acc_glove | image_url: width: 600 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.acc_glove.alt | default: 'The ENSŌ Cleaning Glove', width: section.settings.acc_glove.width, height: section.settings.acc_glove.height -}}{%- else -%}<img src="{{ 'dm-acc-cleaning-glove-1.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="The ENSŌ Cleaning Glove">{%- endif -%}<span><b>Quicker with the ENSŌ Cleaning Glove</b>Its steel mesh palm cleans the cup, the basket and the screens in a few strokes.<em>See the Cleaning Glove ›</em></span></a><h3>The cap</h3><p class="h3lead">No electronics in the cap: all three parts go under the tap.</p><div class="slider tslider slider--grid" style="--n:1"><div class="slides"><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">1</span><b>Rinse all three parts</b><p>The shell, the plate and the insert. Let them dry fully before the next session.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img">{%- if section.settings.cap_parts_rinse != blank -%}{{- section.settings.cap_parts_rinse | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.cap_parts_rinse.alt | default: '', width: section.settings.cap_parts_rinse.width, height: section.settings.cap_parts_rinse.height -}}{%- else -%}<img src="{{ 'dm-s-cap-parts-rinse.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}</div></figure></div><button class="nav prev" aria-label="Previous">‹</button><button class="nav next" aria-label="Next">›</button></div><h3>Every few sessions: the shaft</h3><p class="h3lead">The heating element never clogs. The shaft below it gets a brush and a rinse every few sessions. Always with the battery in.</p><div class="slider tslider slider--grid" style="--n:3"><div class="slides"><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">1</span><b>Battery in, latch closed</b><p>Give Diamond an hour to an hour and a half to cool, then lift the cap off. Leave the battery in with the latch closed the whole time: it closes the bay so no water reaches the contacts.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img">{%- if section.settings.clean_capoff_back != blank -%}{{- section.settings.clean_capoff_back | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.clean_capoff_back.alt | default: '', width: section.settings.clean_capoff_back.width, height: section.settings.clean_capoff_back.height -}}{%- else -%}<img src="{{ 'dm-s-clean-capoff-back-brush.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}</div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">2</span><b>Brush the shaft</b><p>Push the cleaning brush through the shaft from the top.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img">{%- if section.settings.clean_shaft_brush != blank -%}{{- section.settings.clean_shaft_brush | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.clean_shaft_brush.alt | default: '', width: section.settings.clean_shaft_brush.width, height: section.settings.clean_shaft_brush.height -}}{%- else -%}<img src="{{ 'dm-s-clean-shaft-brush.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}</div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">3</span><b>Rinse from the top</b><p>A gentle stream from the top only, the battery fitted. Let everything dry fully.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img">{%- if section.settings.rinse_shaft != blank -%}{{- section.settings.rinse_shaft | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.rinse_shaft.alt | default: '', width: section.settings.rinse_shaft.width, height: section.settings.rinse_shaft.height -}}{%- else -%}<img src="{{ 'dm-s-ok-rinse-shaft.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}</div></figure></div><button class="nav prev" aria-label="Previous">‹</button><button class="nav next" aria-label="Next">›</button></div><h3>Never</h3><p class="h3lead">The battery and the contacts never get wet.</p><div class="slider tslider slider--grid slider--never" style="--n:2"><div class="slides"><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">1</span><b>No water in the battery bay</b><p>Rinse from the top only, with the battery fitted.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img">{%- if section.settings.dont_water_bay != blank -%}{{- section.settings.dont_water_bay | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.dont_water_bay.alt | default: '', width: section.settings.dont_water_bay.width, height: section.settings.dont_water_bay.height -}}{%- else -%}<img src="{{ 'dm-s-dont-water-bay.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}</div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">2</span><b>Keep the battery dry</b><p>The battery never goes under water. Neither does the body, or into a dishwasher.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img">{%- if section.settings.dont_water_battery != blank -%}{{- section.settings.dont_water_battery | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.dont_water_battery.alt | default: '', width: section.settings.dont_water_battery.width, height: section.settings.dont_water_battery.height -}}{%- else -%}<img src="{{ 'dm-s-dont-water-battery.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}</div></figure></div><button class="nav prev" aria-label="Previous">‹</button><button class="nav next" aria-label="Next">›</button></div><p class="sp-label">Makes it quicker</p><div class="spares"><a class="spare" href="../partner-v2/product.html#e-multitool">{%- if section.settings.acc_multi_tool != blank -%}{{- section.settings.acc_multi_tool | image_url: width: 400 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.acc_multi_tool.alt | default: '', width: section.settings.acc_multi_tool.width, height: section.settings.acc_multi_tool.height -}}{%- else -%}<img src="{{ 'dm-acc-multi-tool-1.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="">{%- endif -%}<span><b>ENSŌ Multi-Tool</b><small>For cleaning and packing</small></span><em>€19.99</em></a></div></section>
</div>

